The general employee classifications in the City of Gainesville shall be as follows:
(1) Council appointments. The appointed service which shall include the city manager, the city attorney, the municipal court judge, the solicitor, the city auditor, and all personnel appointed by the governing body pursuant to this Charter except employees in the classified service appointed as provided in this Charter;
(2) Appointed officials. Appointments by the city manager. These employees serve at will and may be removed at any time;
(3) Classified appointment. Regular full-time employees covered by the provisions of the merit system; and
(4) Nonclassified service. Includes all part-time or temporary employees as designated by the city manager.

